# Backend API

- Session cookie auth + Argon2. No auth-as-a-service.
- Enforce `context/role-isolation.md` in the service layer on list/get/export.
- Track-scoped judges never see other tracks.
- Every UI action must appear in OpenAPI (API First bonus).
- Mutations write `audit_events` an organizer can read without SQL.
- Deadlines are server-enforced. Client timestamps are not trusted.
- Load `.skills/role-isolation/SKILL.md` before touching score or vote endpoints.
